{
  "name": "血怒刺青 Blood Fury Tattoo",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/tools/scribal/burnisher-tooth.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">覆盖区域：两条肢体与躯干</span></p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM:12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">该魔法刺青用一根特殊的针制作，该刺青的形状与颜色能够唤起愤怒。</span><br /><em><strong>刺青同调。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">同调此物品时，你需要将针持握，并抵在你想要让刺</span><span class=\"GramE\">青出现</span>的那处皮肤上。当同调完成时，针头会化为墨水再变成刺青。若你与刺青的同调结束，刺青会消失，针头会再次出现在你的位置中。<br /><em><strong>嗜血狂袭。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">刺</span><span class=\"GramE\">青具有</span>10<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能，其在每天黎明时恢复所有已消耗的充能。当刺青在你的皮肤上时，你获得以下增益：</span></p><ul><li><p class=\"wordsection1\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM:12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">当你以武器攻击命中一个生物时，你可以消耗</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能对目标造成额外的</span>[[/r 4d6]]<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">暗蚀伤害，同时你恢复数值等于所</span><span class=\"GramE\">造成黯蚀伤害</span>的生命值。</p></li><li><p class=\"wordsection1\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM:12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">当一个你可见的生物对你造成伤害时，你可以消耗</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能并使用你的反应对那个生物发动一次近战攻击，这次攻击的攻击检定具有优势。</span></p></li></ul></div></div>",
